# Customer browse flow. Needs {{cityId}} and {{movieId}}, plus an OPEN show (shows.http).

### Movies now showing in the city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cities/{{cityId}}/movies
X-User-Id: 5b1e3f60-0000-4000-8000-00000000c001
X-User-Role: CUSTOMER

### Date strip for a movie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/dates?cityId={{cityId}}
X-User-Id: 5b1e3f60-0000-4000-8000-00000000c001
X-User-Role: CUSTOMER

### Theaters and showtimes for a date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/shows?cityId={{cityId}}&date=2026-10-03
X-User-Id: 5b1e3f60-0000-4000-8000-00000000c001
X-User-Role: CUSTOMER

### Same, evening and night only, Hindi 2D
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/shows?cityId={{cityId}}&date=2026-10-03&slot=EVENING,NIGHT&language=HI&format=2D
X-User-Id: 5b1e3f60-0000-4000-8000-00000000c001
X-User-Role: CUSTOMER

### Seat map for a show (needs {{showId}} of an OPEN show)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shows/{{showId}}/seats
X-User-Id: 5b1e3f60-0000-4000-8000-00000000c001
X-User-Role: CUSTOMER
